<title>USA: American Bio Medica in $3.8 mln/yr deal.</title>
<headline>American Bio Medica in $3.8 mln/yr deal.</headline>
<dateline>ANCRAMDALE, N.Y. 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>American Bio Medica Corp said Wednesday that it has an agreement to sell a minimum of 300,000 units of its Rapid Drug Screen a year to PharmaGen SA, valued at a minimum of about $3.8 million annually.</p>
<p>A unit of Zeltia SA, PharmaGen is a biopharmaceutical company with distribution throughout Europe and Latin America.</p>
<p>American Bio said that the initial order of its one-step test for drugs has already been delivered and that remaining units ordered for 1997 are scheduled for shipment throughout the coming year.</p>
</text>
